entries[160661] = { ["name"] = "Recipe: Fire Ammonite Oil", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUse: Teaches you how to make Fire Ammonite Oil.\nCreate 4 Fire Ammonite Oil. Actual yield may vary based on skill level.\nRequires Draenor Alchemy (1)\nSell Price:\nFire Ammonite Oil\nUse: Cures diseases and reduces the duration of newly applied diseases by 50% for 2 min. Only works in Draenor. Cannot be used in instances. Ineffective above 50. (2 Min Cooldown)\n\"Burns away infection without damage to the host.\"\nRequires Fire Ammonite Tentacle (10)" }
